   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and
steep seas 7 to 10 ft due to a mix of wind seas and west-
northwest swell at 11 seconds expected.

* WHERE...Areas from 5 nm to 10 nm from Charleston south and
within 5 nm near Cape Blanco. All areas beyond 10 nm from shore
from Reedsport south.

* WHEN...From 5 PM this afternoon to 5 PM PDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds and/or steep seas could capsize or
damage smaller vessels.

* View the hazard area in detail at https://go.usa.gov/x6hks</Snippet>
