   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...For the Gale Warning, north winds 30 to 40 kt with
gusts up to 45 kt and seas 8 to 13 ft expected. For the Storm
Warning, north winds 30 to 40 kt with gusts up to 50 kt and
seas 10 to 15 ft expected.

* WHERE...Waters from Surf City NC to Little River Inlet SC from
20 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...For the Gale Warning, from noon today to 8 AM EDT
Sunday. For the Storm Warning, from 8 AM Sunday to 2 AM EDT
Monday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous seas will capsize or
damage vessels and reduce visibility.</Snippet>
