   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...For the Gale Warning, northeast winds 25 to 35 kt with
gusts up to 40 kt and seas 7 to 10 ft. For the Small Craft
Advisory, northeast winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt
and seas 5 to 8 ft expected.

* WHERE...Portions of the Gulf of America.

* WHEN...For the Gale Warning, until 1 PM CDT Saturday. For the
Small Craft Advisory, from 1 PM Saturday to 7 AM CDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.</Snippet>
